cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MultiView Product Renderer in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MultiView Product Renderer"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Danyal
    family-names: Sarfraz
version: 1.12.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Danyals-code/Addon-for-MultiView-Rendering-AMVR"
abstract: >-
  A Blender add-on that turns CAD (STEP, IGES) and mesh files into standardized
  multi-view image sets and datasets: canonical camera rigs or published
  protocols, studio lighting, clay, line-art, depth, normal and part-ID passes,
  camera poses, COCO and BOP annotations, vector engineering drawings, seeded
  randomization, and a provenance manifest with Croissant metadata.
keywords:
  - Blender
  - CAD
  - STEP
  - multi-view rendering
  - synthetic data
  - dataset generation
  - engineering drawings
